Original commit body from 00edf52:

Implements the Data Models section from ADR-0005. Detects data models
(ORM entities, DTOs, domain objects) via multiple signals:
- YAML framework pattern concepts ("model", "schema", "entity")
- Decorator patterns (@dataclass, @Entity, @Table)
- Base class patterns (BaseModel, Model, Base, Schema)
- Naming conventions (classes ending in Model, Entity, Schema, DTO)

Data models are ranked by confidence and centrality, with the section
appearing between Entry Points and Source Files in the sketch output.
